  (wire (pts (xy 153.81 285) (xy 156.35 285)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "356552b4-4f1d-5388-a197-842e2662f235"))
  (label "I2S_DIN_R" (at 156.35 285 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "88bf3a16-a860-51ba-b142-72ae90a1dcfe"))
  (text "Node straps: both open = 0x10 (audio bridge default); JP1 = 0x11; JP2 = 0x12.  JP3 closed = rear amps copy the front stream (use it until the firmware drives GPIO26; leave GPIO26 an input then)." (at 20 300 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "95f215d6-4e65-5751-a3c7-e4cf87db7507"))
  (text "Each MAX98357A is one mono channel: GAIN is tied straight to +5 V (6 dB, the lowest fixed gain, less noise into a line input).\nSD_MODE picks the channel: to +5 V = left, through 680k = right (same as the first revision).  Front pair shares data line F, rear pair R.\nLine output: OUT+ only (the other half of the bridge is not used), DC block, 1.5k / 1k divider with 3.3n across the 1k (about 80 kHz low-pass), roughly 0.5 Vrms at full scale, ~600 R source." (at 290 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "be41c8a8-ace6-59c3-a890-334f2b95924d"))
